        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:issue"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n\"8. Before examining the merits of the present case we must advert to the discussion as to the ambit and scope of the power which the Courts including the High Court can exercise under Section 397 and Section 482 of the Code."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3e2bb4cbe43f43c0870b3c5747ec961f_31",
