        "text_preview": "Section 397 of the Code vests Jamil vs State on 21 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/181648683/\n2 the Court with the power to call for and examine the records of [2024:RJ-JP:11523]\n(4 of 10) [CRLR-858/2005] an inferior"
