          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There has to be a well founded error and it may not be appropriate for the Court to scrutinise the order,\nwhich upon the face of it is a token of careful consideration and appears to be in accordance with law."
